/name code-audit-chain
/description Sequential deep-dive: bug-hunter finds issues, then perf-analyst reviews same files for perf, then synthesizer ranks everything. Each agent's output feeds into the next.
/trigger manual
/budget 6.00

# Agent 1: Find bugs first
/chain bug-hunter "Scan this project's src/ directories for logic bugs. Find: missing awaits on async calls, race conditions, off-by-one errors, unguarded null access, Map.get without nullish handling, event listener leaks, unclosed resources. Report each as: file:line, 3-5 line snippet, what breaks, the fix. Be thorough but only report confirmed issues."

# Agent 2: Pipeline bug-hunter's output into perf-analyst (bug-hunter already ran, result reused)
/chain bug-hunter -> perf-analyst

# Agent 3: Collect both outputs and synthesize
/spawn synthesizer
/seed synthesizer user "You will receive findings from a bug-hunter and perf-analyst. Deduplicate, rank by severity, output max 15 items as: severity, file:line, snippet, what breaks, fix as code."
/collect bug-hunter perf-analyst -> synthesizer

/wait synthesizer complete
/log "Chain audit complete — see #synthesizer"
